 "what_this_is": "Every file of this folder, with its sha256 and where it comes from. code_and_data is checked by demo/run_episode.py before every run (demo/public_adapter.verify_distribution); other_files are listed for reference only. origin snapshot: from the frozen code snapshot that produced the recorded episodes; demo_launcher: from the launcher that ran them; recorded_choice: derived from the original record files (see each PROVENANCE.json); new: written for this package. change identical: the same bytes as the source; comments_or_docstrings_only: only comments and docstrings differ from the source, proven by an equal code_ast_sha256 (the file's syntax tree without docstrings, comments or positions, checked again by the launcher for robot files); publication_edits: a launcher file whose listed values were replaced for publication (private folder paths, the time zone of its time stamps, references to private notes, a person's name in a message, the reviewer's name in the seed table records), its logic unchanged; new: no source file. No robot file (origin snapshot) has a changed executable part. The only new code is demo/run_episode.py and demo/public_adapter.py."
